    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/ef7ed74542b8c5609d40d14ea0aac354.poster.avif?t=1622183978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/ef7ed74542b8c5609d40d14ea0aac354.webm?t=1622183978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/ef7ed74542b8c5609d40d14ea0aac354.mp4?t=1622183978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Battle system characterized by rhythm.<br></li><li>Innovative mechanics based on rhythm.<br></li><li>Environmental narrative without any text.<br></li><li>Eye-catching artistic visuals.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/c1a653ac2f85dce01ed43f2fc703c171.poster.avif?t=1622183978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/c1a653ac2f85dce01ed43f2fc703c171.webm?t=1622183978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/c1a653ac2f85dce01ed43f2fc703c171.mp4?t=1622183978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Arima is a musical game with narratives and objectives that are marked by sound. It is an Adventure set in a fantastic world. The player will live an auditory experience, where the mechanics revolve around music.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/862e417b4ff230717ee4386fb70344f1.poster.avif?t=1622183978\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/862e417b4ff230717ee4386fb70344f1.webm?t=1622183978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1112450/extras/862e417b4ff230717ee4386fb70344f1.mp4?t=1622183978\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
